abstract: 'Research software, structured literature-derived records, and supporting instruments for reporting-quality
  auditing, robustness assessment, and model-family recommendation in stealth assessment. Associated article:
  Auditing Reporting Quality in Affective Computing for Stealth Assessment: Development and Evaluation
  of a 16-Item Checklist. Version 1.0.0 is being prepared for archival; no release date or archival DOI
  has been assigned. Source code is licensed under MIT; documents, tabular data, and non-code artifacts
  are licensed under CC BY 4.0.'
